[node name="Label2" type="Label" parent="Border/HBoxContainer/Sidebar/ColorRect/Pages/PageChatterPacks/PageContainer/VBoxContainer/ExplainBox_clipconfig/HBoxContainer2"]
custom_minimum_size = Vector2(764, 0)
layout_mode = 2
theme_override_fonts/font = ExtResource("4_4t6lw")
text = "The config file is required for the game to know what keywords every audio sample should have. The same keywords can be assigned to multiple samples, and a sample will be chosen at random. The config also specifies data about the pack. A dedicated editor will be available at a later date.

There are three sections for a chatter config file. None are required for the pack to work.

Example of a chatter config:
-------------------------------------------------------------------------
[data]
title = \"My Chatter Pack\"
icon = \"my_icon\"
authors = [\"Me\", \"My friend\"]
volume = 0.70

[exact_keywords]
lets_go.wav = [\"twitchEmoteLetsGo\"]
huh.mp3 = [\"HUH\", \"HUHH\"]

[broad_keywords]
clap.ogg = [\"clap\", \"👏\"]
yes1.wav = [\"yes\"]
yes2.wav = [\"yes\"]
yes3.wav = [\"yes\"]
-------------------------------------------------------------------------

The \"data\" section lets you specify:
  * A display name (if you don't want it to use the folder name).
  * The image to use as an icon (can also name an image \"_icon\" to use it automatically).
  * The author or authors.
  * Volume adjustment for the pack's samples. Default is 1.0 (100%).

The \"exact_keywords\" section dictates the samples that play for an exact keyword match. They must be the same word and the same capitalization. Useful for the names of Twitch emotes. For example, the exact keyword \"Clap\" will ONLY trigger for \"Clap\".

The \"broad_keywords\" section dictates the samples that play when the keyword is found in the checked word. It is case-insensitive. For example, the broad keyword \"clap\" will trigger for ALL of the following: \"clap\", \"CLAP\", \"clapping\", \"Clap2\", \"LeftClap\", \"xXx_cclapp_xXx\".
"
autowrap_mode = 2

